sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cam as Dash cam
  participant GW as Gateway (Pi)
  participant R as Road view (Jetson)
  participant UI as Cabin display
  participant Au as Car audio
  Cam->>GW: video over the dash cam's Wi-Fi
  GW->>R: frames
  R->>R: blur heads and plates — no blur, no picture
  R->>R: detect objects · openpilot lanes and path · drop our own bonnet
  R->>UI: blurred picture ≤ 10 fps + boxes + "in path"
  opt close and in path
    R->>Au: hazard
    Au->>UI: "Watch out ahead."
  end
